{
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.56,
      "size": 40896,
      "text": "桌上放一摞纸，整整齐齐。现在用手把它推歪，变成一个斜的柱体。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.9,
      "size": 46368,
      "text": "纸还是那些纸，每一张的面积都没变，所以总的体积也没变。这个道理谁都懂。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.5,
      "size": 56016,
      "text": "卡瓦列里在一六三五年把它写成一条原理：两个立体如果被任意平行平面截得的面积总相等，那么体积相等。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "pyramid",
      "line_id": "py-1",
      "filename": "pyramid-py-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/pyramid-py-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.58,
      "size": 41328,
      "text": "这条原理最有用的推论之一，是棱锥的体积公式：底面积乘高再除以三。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "pyramid",
      "line_id": "py-2",
      "filename": "pyramid-py-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/pyramid-py-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.94,
      "size": 63072,
      "text": "为什么是三？看截面。在高度 h 处，棱锥的截面是底面按比例缩小的相似形，比例是一减 h 除以 H。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "pyramid",
      "line_id": "py-3",
      "filename": "pyramid-py-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/pyramid-py-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.59,
      "size": 57456,
      "text": "面积按比例的平方缩小，把这个平方从零积到 H，得到的正是三分之一。屏幕上的数值积分验证了这点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "same",
      "line_id": "sm-1",
      "filename": "same-sm-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/same-sm-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.08,
      "size": 49248,
      "text": "请切到棱锥那个场景。左边是底面为圆的棱锥，右边是圆锥，两者同底同高。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "same",
      "line_id": "sm-2",
      "filename": "same-sm-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/same-sm-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.1,
      "size": 49536,
      "text": "拖动滑块，你会看到两片黄色截面的面积始终完全相等，屏幕中间显示等号。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "same",
      "line_id": "sm-3",
      "filename": "same-sm-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/same-sm-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.29,
      "size": 52560,
      "text": "既然处处相等，体积就必然相等。这就是这条原理的用法：把难算的立体换成好算的。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "sphere",
      "line_id": "sp-1",
      "filename": "sphere-sp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/sphere-sp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.92,
      "size": 46656,
      "text": "最漂亮的应用来自阿基米德，比卡瓦列里早了一千八百年。他要算球的体积。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "sphere",
      "line_id": "sp-2",
      "filename": "sphere-sp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/sphere-sp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.26,
      "size": 68112,
      "text": "取一个半球，半径 r。在高度 h 处切一刀，截面是个圆，半径是根号下 r 平方减 h 平方，面积就是圆周率乘这个差。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "sphere",
      "line_id": "sp-3",
      "filename": "sphere-sp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/sphere-sp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 5.1,
      "size": 81648,
      "text": "再取一个圆柱，从中挖掉一个倒立的圆锥。同样高度切一刀，截面是个环，外圆半径 r，内圆半径恰好是 h。环的面积也是圆周率乘那个差。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "archimedes",
      "line_id": "ar-1",
      "filename": "archimedes-ar-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/archimedes-ar-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "请切到球那个场景，拖动滑块从底到顶。两片截面的面积读数始终一致，偏差是零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "archimedes",
      "line_id": "ar-2",
      "filename": "archimedes-ar-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/archimedes-ar-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.01,
      "size": 64224,
      "text": "于是半球的体积等于圆柱减圆锥，也就是圆周率乘 r 立方，减去它的三分之一，等于三分之二倍圆周率乘 r 立方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "archimedes",
      "line_id": "ar-3",
      "filename": "archimedes-ar-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/archimedes-ar-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.94,
      "size": 79056,
      "text": "乘以二得到整球：三分之四倍圆周率乘 r 立方。阿基米德还发现球与外接圆柱的体积比恰好是二比三，他自豪到把这个图刻在了墓碑上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.68,
      "size": 42912,
      "text": "第一，截面积处处相等的两个立体，体积必定相等，这就是卡瓦列里原理。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.22,
      "size": 35568,
      "text": "第二，棱锥公式里的三分之一，来自截面按比例平方收缩后的积分。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "cavalieri",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/cavalieri/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.52,
      "size": 72288,
      "text": "第三，阿基米德用半球与「圆柱挖去圆锥」截面相同，算出了球体积，而这条原理本质上就是积分。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
